post_install() {
    cat <<'MSG'
kwin-canvas-passthrough: KWin loads the plugin at login, so log out and in
once. `make plugin-status` in a kwin-canvas checkout, or
    qdbus6 org.kde.KWin /KWinCanvas org.kde.kwin.canvas.Passthrough.probe
tells whether it answers. After a kwin upgrade, rebuild this package.
MSG
}
post_upgrade() {
    post_install
}
